Modifications by Joanna Woo for KoineGreekPlus:
1. Lengthened glyph U+0305 slightly to show up better on the AndBible app.
2. Detached glyphs U+03B1 to U+03C9, U+03DF and U+03F2 from U+0061 to U+007A, in order to free up the latin characters for notes.
3. Changed metrics to more standard numbers (for things like highlighting to work properly).

Modifications by Joanna Woo for KoineGreekPapyrus:
The same as KoineGreekPlus and:
4. Changed the space character U+0020 to be very small to eliminate spaces (like in papyri).
5. Changed the variant unit delimiters ⸢ and ⸣ to be blank and of small width to disappear from the display. 
6. Changed the hypen - to be blank and of small width to disappear from the display (so that words broken over two lines are not marked).
